# Fall/Winter Whiskey Sour

Based on Patrick’s coworker’s advice

{ rating="5" image="None" }
:::
:::

## Ingredients

- [ ] 2 oz [bourbon]{ ing="bourbon" }
- [ ] 0.5 oz [lemon juice]{ ing="lemon-juice" }
- [ ] 0.5 oz [maple syrup]{ ing="maple-syrup" }
- [ ] [Egg white]{ ing="egg-white" } (Optional)
- [ ] [Cinnamon stick]{ ing="cinnamon-stick" }, garnish

## Recipe

1. Combine all ingredients sans cinnamon in shaker
1. Fill shaker with ice and shake vigorously for 15-20 seconds
1. Strain into a whiskey glass
1. Scrape cinnamon with side of knife over glass 5-6 times, then drop [stick]{ ing="cinnamon-stick" } into glass
